stateDiagram-
 [*] --> NOT_STARTED
 NOT_STARTED --> CLASSIFIED: classify execution class
 CLASSIFIED --> PREFLIGHT_READY: source/scope/risk checked
 PREFLIGHT_READY --> PERMISSION_CHECKED: tool policy checked
 PERMISSION_CHECKED --> APPROVED_OR_ALLOWED: allowed or approved
 PERMISSION_CHECKED --> APPROVAL_REQUIRED: high-risk action
 PERMISSION_CHECKED --> BLOCKED: hard stop or missing input
 APPROVAL_REQUIRED --> APPROVED_OR_ALLOWED: explicit approval received
 APPROVAL_REQUIRED --> BLOCKED: approval rejected or absent
 APPROVED_OR_ALLOWED --> EXECUTING: run smallest safe action
 EXECUTING --> POST_EXECUTION_VERIFYING: action completed
 EXECUTING --> FAILED: command/tool/action failed
 POST_EXECUTION_VERIFYING --> VALIDATING: verify files/resources/commands
 POST_EXECUTION_VERIFYING --> ROLLBACK_REQUIRED: unexpected side effect
 VALIDATING --> REPORTING: validation completed or not-run recorded
 VALIDATING --> VALIDATION_FAILED: validation failed
 REPORTING --> DONE
 FAILED --> REPORTING
 VALIDATION_FAILED --> REPORTING
 BLOCKED --> REPORTING
 ROLLBACK_REQUIRED --> REPORTING
 DONE --> [*]
